[0.036, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[4;62r\u001b[62;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;68r\u001b[4;245H┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\r\n\u001b[244C┃\r\u001b[41B \u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1mAsked user \u001b[mWaiting for response \r\n   \u001b[90m│\u001b[240C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[m Before I start: I'll make a copy of the kirklands.com site's design and content, give it the company's own name/branding, and share it as a portal link — the original site is never touched. I've already confirmed the required setup\u001b[8C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[m (credentials and design-matching tool are in place), so no action needed there.\u001b[160C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[240C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[m One thing I do need to confirm: what company name should this demo be branded under? (I'm assuming \"Kirklands\" based on the URL, but I won't guess without confirming.)\u001b[72C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[240C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[90m│\u001b[m Also note: per your instruction, I'll base the new demo branch off the local `skill-improvement` branch instead of `origin/main`.\u001b[110C"]
